    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "利用 s 平面形式的第一种方法是将劳斯-赫尔维茨判据进行推广以确定相对稳定性。这可以通过变量替换来实现，该变换平移 s 平面坐标轴以利用劳斯-赫尔维茨判据。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "A first approach using an s-plane formulation is to extend the Routh-Hurwitz criterion to ascertain relative stability. This can be accomplished by utilizing a change of variable, which shifts the s-plane axis in order to utilize the Routh-Hurwitz criterion.",
